        <div class="drivers">The dissolution bill's 106-0 first reading and the Knesset's procedural dissolution pressure by mid-July reflect a coalition that has formally chosen early elections — not a surprise collapse but an orchestrated wind-down; coalition holds 60 seats (UTJ departed July 2025) with formal majority loss not yet confirmed per TIER1 evidence.</div>
